[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2627862664","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102252#issuecomment-2627862664","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102252","id":2627862664,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cogCI","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T17:27:27Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T17:27:27Z","body":"This needs a minimal project to help test and fix, the error clearly doesn't come from the code displayed as it doesn't reference either of those properties, so we'll need more information to be able to identify this bug","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2627862664/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2627993681","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102252#issuecomment-2627993681","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102252","id":2627993681,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cpABR","user":{"login":"sszigeti","id":2530086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzAwODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2530086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti","html_url":"https://github.com/sszigeti","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T17:59:47Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T18:02:05Z","body":"Found the problem: the .tres files still have the extra `.remap` file extension in the exported version, so I had to do this extra step to correct the file names in my Util.LoadResourcesFromPath helper:\n\n```gdscript\nif file_name.ends_with(\".remap\"):\n\tfile_name = file_name.trim_suffix(\".remap\")\n```\n\nI was under the impression that this has already been fixed and merged: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/66014 and also: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96590\n\nIt's very deceiving that this was working in the editor, and failed in the exported product.\n\n**Clarification:** My game didn't crash in 4.3, because it still had the above mentioned correction for getting rid of the \".remap\" extension, but I have prematurely removed that conversion in 4.4, because of the mentioned, merged PRs.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2627993681/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2627999921","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102252#issuecomment-2627999921","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102252","id":2627999921,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cpBix","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T18:03:24Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T18:03:24Z","body":"That fix was for getting lists of files, not dealing with remap files, you still need to handle that as the original files are not kept","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2627999921/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628007436","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102252#issuecomment-2628007436","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102252","id":2628007436,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cpDYM","user":{"login":"sszigeti","id":2530086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzAwODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2530086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti","html_url":"https://github.com/sszigeti","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T18:07:57Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T18:07:57Z","body":"Understood.\n\nDo I need to create a separate feature proposal to also have the \".remap\" extensions removed from file names, or is this issue sufficient? It seems to me the current behavior is rather counter-intuitive.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628007436/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628013363","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102252#issuecomment-2628013363","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102252","id":2628013363,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cpE0z","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T18:11:33Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T18:11:33Z","body":"That wouldn't be possible due to how things work internally, you shouldn't access a lot of raw files in the engine directly with `FileAccess` but instead use `ResourceLoader`, [as documented](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_fileaccess.html#class-fileaccess-method-file-exists), the remap extensions aren't *added* they are separate files, and the original files aren't exported because of how the export works\n\n`FileAccess` isn't suitable to access files that have been imported or otherwise been processed, as the output isn't the same as the input file, so you shouldn't be doing file operations on them, for example you shouldn't try to read raw text from an exported `.tres` file, you should use `ResourceLoader` instead","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628013363/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628059299","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102252#issuecomment-2628059299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102252","id":2628059299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cpQCj","user":{"login":"sszigeti","id":2530086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzAwODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2530086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti","html_url":"https://github.com/sszigeti","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T18:40:54Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T18:40:54Z","body":"Is `ResourceLoader.list_directory` the correct way to discover files in a directory (under `res:`) in Godot 4.4?\n\nThis seems to be working both in the editor and in the exported game:\n\n```gdscript\nstatic func LoadResourcesFromPath(resPath:String, res_extension:String, success_cb:Callable, validator_cb=null):\n\tassert(validator_cb == null or validator_cb is Callable)\n\tfor file_name in ResourceLoader.list_directory(resPath):\n\t\tif file_name.ends_with(res_extension):\n\t\t\tvar entry:Resource = load(\"%s/%s\" % [resPath, file_name])\n\t\t\tif validator_cb is Callable:\n\t\t\t\tif not validator_cb.call(entry, file_name):\n\t\t\t\t\tprinterr(\"Loaded resource failed validation: %s :: %s\" % [entry, file_name])\n\t\t\t\t\tbreakpoint\n\t\t\tsuccess_cb.call(entry)\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628059299/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628063110","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102252#issuecomment-2628063110","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102252","id":2628063110,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cpQ-G","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T18:43:25Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T18:43:25Z","body":"It shows the files accessible to `ResourceLoader`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628063110/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628071239","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102252#issuecomment-2628071239","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102252","id":2628071239,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cpS9H","user":{"login":"sszigeti","id":2530086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzAwODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2530086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti","html_url":"https://github.com/sszigeti","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sszigeti/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T18:48:34Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T18:48:34Z","body":"I think, with your kind guidance, I have realized that I've been working against Godot's expected workflow and misused deeper level features that are now better exposed in 4.4.\n\nI think this issue can be closed, as this wasn't actually a bug.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628071239/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628075348","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102252#issuecomment-2628075348","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102252","id":2628075348,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cpT9U","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T18:51:08Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T18:51:08Z","body":"Thank you for working this through with me!\n\nI will note this (and other reports of the same type) as part of a collection of known issues and snags for an upcoming documentation section, with the different uses of `FileAccess` and `ResourceLoader` and what works and what doesn't work with exported projects, as it's very confusing even for highly experienced users, given how files are imported or not, converted to binary format or not, remapped for translation or not, etc.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628075348/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]